    {
      "bbox": [
        609,
        2388,
        1962,
        2862
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1. Employees who are in unclassified or not-classified or pending classification or exempt positions, and persons paid on basis of Consultants (Rule 5.7.1 of the City Civil Service Commission), shall not be paid for accumulated annual leave or overtime or accumulated sick leave, nor shall they be paid for terminal leave upon termination of services or upon retirement. The above regulation also applies to employees who are in non-competitive positions, the salaries of which are $16,000 or above per annum.",
